00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:59.000
As the local population has never peaked beyond 2,600 people, Mountain City residents remain close-knit. They live a slow-paced lifestyle among the mountains, valleys and forests. The summers are warm, the winters are short, cold and wet, and it's partly cloudy all year round. There is no public transport, so everybody has a car, and that car is more often than not a pickup truck. Most residents own a gun. Many people own several.
由于当地人口从未超过 2,600 人，山城居民之间的关系非常紧密。他们在群山、山谷和森林间过着慢节奏的生活。这里的夏天温暖，冬天短暂、寒冷且潮湿，全年部分时间多云。这里没有公共交通，因此每个人都有一辆汽车，而且这辆车十有八九是皮卡。大多数居民都拥有一把枪，很多人甚至拥有好几把。

