00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:45.000
At around 6.30 on the morning of January 31, 2012, Brad Osborne was making his usual drive to pick up his friend and co-worker, Bill Payne. The two men worked at the Parkdale Mills textile plant and often carpooled to work. Bill was staying in his father's white single-story weatherboard house in Mountain City. He lived there with his partner, Billy Jean Hayworth, and their infant son, as well as Bill's father, Billy Ray Payne, better known around town as Poor Bill. When Brad Osborne arrived at the Payne house, Poor Bill had already left for work about an hour earlier.
2012 年 1 月 31 日早上 6 点半左右，布拉德·奥斯本（Brad Osborne）像往常一样开车去接他的朋友兼同事比尔·佩恩（Bill Payne）。这两个人在帕克代尔米尔斯（Parkdale Mills）纺织厂工作，经常拼车上班。比尔住在山城他父亲的一栋白色单层木板房里。他和伴侣比利·琼·海沃思（Billy Jean Hayworth）及他们的小儿子，还有比尔的父亲比利·雷·佩恩（Billy Ray Payne）一起住在那里，镇上的人们更习惯叫他“穷比尔”（Poor Bill）。当布拉德·奥斯本到达佩恩家时，“穷比尔”大约在一小时前就已经出门上班了。

5
00:02:45.000 --> 00:03:28.000
Brad pulled into the driveway and remained in his car. Usually, Bill would emerge from the house when Brad arrived. They started work at 7am, but the drive to the factory wasn't far. The sun had yet to rise, and Brad could see a light emanating from Bill's bedroom window, though there was no movement within. Brad tutored the horn and waited, but Bill didn't appear. He tried calling Bill's cell phone, but was unable to get through. Minutes passed, and Brad became increasingly concerned about being late for work.
布拉德把车开进车道，坐在车里没动。通常情况下，布拉德一到，比尔就会从屋里出来。他们早上 7 点上班，但开车到工厂并不远。太阳还没升起，布拉德可以看到比尔的卧室窗户透出灯光，但里面没有任何动静。布拉德按了两下喇叭并等待着，但比尔没有出现。他尝试拨打比尔的手机，但打不通。几分钟过去了，布拉德越来越担心上班迟到。

6
00:03:28.000 --> 00:04:10.000
He got out of his car and walked over to the house to hurry his friend along. Knowing that it was rarely locked, Brad headed to a sliding glass door at the rear of the house. When he's knocks when unanswered, Brad let himself in. An alarm clock was going off in one of the bedrooms. Brad picked up the landline in the living room and called Bill's cell again, but he couldn't hear it ring. Then, Brad heard something. It sounded like the quiet whimper of a baby. Not feeling comfortable with going into the bedrooms where Billy Jean and her baby might be
他下了车，走到屋前催促他的朋友快一点。布拉德知道门通常不上锁，便径直走向房子后方的推拉玻璃门。在敲门无人应答后，布拉德自己推门走了进去。其中一间卧室里正响着闹钟。布拉德拿起客厅里的座机再次拨打比尔的手机，但他听不到手机铃声。接着，布拉德听到了一些声音。听起来像是一个婴儿轻轻的呜咽声。布拉德觉得走进比利·琼和她孩子可能在睡觉的卧室不太妥当，

7
00:04:10.000 --> 00:05:01.000
sleeping, Brad called out once more. He was met with silence and took this as his cue to leave. Brad drove alone to the textile plant, only to discover that Bill was not there, and did not turn up as the morning wore on. Later that morning at around 10, another visitor pulled up to the pain house. Roy Stevens arrived to pick up his mail, which had been sent to poor Bill's place. His wife, Linda, stayed in the car while Roy let himself in via the rear sliding glass door. Roy hollered out, sure that somebody must be home. After receiving no response, he ventured down the hallway towards the bedrooms.
于是他又大声喊了几句。迎接他的是一片寂静，他把这当作自己该离开的信号。布拉德独自开车去了纺织厂，结果发现比尔不在那儿，而且随着早晨过去也没有出现。当天上午 10 点左右，另一位访客将车停在了佩恩家门口。罗伊·斯蒂芬斯（Roy Stevens）来取寄到“穷比尔”住处的信件。他的妻子琳达留在车里，而罗伊则通过后方的推拉玻璃门自己走了进去。罗伊大声喊了几声，确信家里应该有人。在没有得到回应后，他顺着走廊朝卧室走去。

8
00:05:01.000 --> 00:06:28.000
As he approached the first room, Roy saw what looked like blood near the doorway. Roy opened the door into the bedroom Bill shared with Billy Jean. He spotted a 36-year-old Bill face up on the bed. His face was badly beaten and blood coagulated around his neck. Roy rushed to Bill, grabbed his arms and shook him, hoping to get a response. When he got none, he raced outside, yelling for Linda. Linda was trained in CPR. She tried to find a pulse in Bill's neck before realizing that his throat had been cut. As his wife called 911, Roy heard something coming from another part of the house. He made his way down the hallway to a second bedroom. Inside, 23-year-old Billy
当他走近第一个房间时，罗伊看到门廊附近有类似血迹的东西。罗伊推开比尔和比利·琼共用的卧室的门。他发现 36岁的比尔面朝上躺在床上。他的脸被打得面目全非，脖子周围凝固着血液。罗伊冲向比尔，抓住他的胳膊并摇晃他，希望能得到回应。在没有得到任何反应后，他冲到屋外，大声呼喊琳达。琳达受过心肺复苏（CPR）培训。她试图在比尔的颈部寻找脉搏，却意识到他的喉咙已经被割断了。就在他的妻子拨打 911 时，罗伊听到屋里另一个地方传来声音。他顺着走廊走向第二间卧室。里面，23 岁的比利·琼·海沃思

