00:08:34.000 --> 00:09:22.000
Murder suicide was swiftly ruled out. The gun and knife used in the crime were missing. Nothing was found at the house that hinted at the perpetrator's identity. Neighbors described Bill Payne and Billy Jean Hayworth as a nice young couple. They didn't hear anything suspicious the morning of the murders. Usually, poor Bill's dog would bark if strangers came to the house, which made the investigators wonder, was the killer someone known to the family, perhaps even welcomed inside. A search of the Payne residence uncovered a small quantity of drugs, including methamphetamine.
谋杀后自杀的可能性很快被排除。犯罪中使用的枪支和刀具不见了。在屋里没有找到任何暗示凶手身份的线索。邻居们将比尔·佩恩和比利·琼·海沃思描述为一对很好的一对年轻夫妇。他们在谋杀案发生的早晨没有听到任何可疑的声音。通常情况下，如果有陌生人来到家里，“穷比尔”的狗会叫，这让调查人员不禁怀疑，凶手是这家人认识的人，甚至可能是被迎进门的人。对佩恩住所的搜查发现了一小批毒品，其中包括甲基苯丙胺（冰毒）。

