00:09:22.000 --> 00:10:14.000
Police also recovered a meth pipe and some prescription medication. Mountain City was going through a drug crisis at the time, but nobody in the Payne household was on the police radar as being part of any large-scale dealing. Billy Jean's best friend, a woman named Lindsay Thomas, had been at the Payne home the day before the murders. Billy Jean mentioned receiving a fresh batch of pills for her and Bill to sell. The couple apparently carried out some low-level drug dealing to make extra cash to buy things for their baby. Lindsay wondered if a buyer was supposed to meet Bill before he left for work, and things turned deadly. This seemed even more likely given that methamphetamine was not found
警方还搜获了一个吸冰毒的烟斗和一些处方药。山城当时正经历一场毒品危机，但佩恩家里的任何人都不在警方的雷达上，不被认为参与了任何大规模贩毒活动。比利·琼的闺蜜琳德丝·托马斯（Lindsay Thomas）在谋杀案发生的前一天去过佩恩家。比利·琼提到收到了一批新药丸，供她和比尔售卖。这对夫妇显然进行了一些低层级的毒品交易，以赚取外快来给他们的孩子买东西。琳德丝想知道是否有一个买家原本要在比尔上班前与他见面，结果事情演变成了致命惨剧。考虑到受害者体内并没有检测出甲基苯丙胺，

