her husband often said strange and untrue things. A doctor later stated that while Buddy's history of hypoxia could have contributed to an impaired state of mind, there were no known cases of hypoxia causing a patient to lie. Both Buddy Potter and Jamie Curd were charged with first degree murder, with bonds set at $1.5 million each, neither made bail. The investigation then took a massive hit when Jamie suddenly recanted his confession. Regardless, detectives remained certain that Jamie and Buddy carried out the murders, and worked quickly on gathering evidence to prove it.
一名特工的任务是从巴迪卡车里发现的垃圾袋中，一片一片地拼凑起那些碎纸。这是一个极其缓慢的过程，但人们相信这些纸条握有能破解此案的关键。这位特工完成了惊人的工作。她成功重建了大约 100 页文件。事实证明，这些文件既具有启发性又令人困惑。其中许多是芭芭拉·波特和一个名叫克里斯（Chris）的神秘男子之间的网上通信打印件。这些消息的日期从 2011 年到 2012 年。芭芭拉称克里斯为“儿子”，并在给他的信息署名为“妈妈”。反过来，他以“爱你们所有人，你们的儿子克里斯”结束信件。

