00:34:29.000 --> 00:35:30.000
One agent was tasked with piecing together the paper in the garbage bags found in Buddy's truck, shred by shred. It was a painstaking slow process, but it was believed that they held a key that would break open the case. The agent did an astonishing job. She managed to reconstruct around 100 pages. They proved to be both enlightening and confounding. Many of them were printouts of online correspondence between Barbara Potter and a mysterious man named Chris. The messages dated from 2011 to 2012. Barbara referred to Chris as son, and signed messages to him as mum. In turn, he ended his with, I love you all, your son, Chris.
警方并不知道波特家有一个儿子。芭芭拉主要向克里斯讲述了他们一家搬到山城后所遭受的骚扰。他们对比尔·佩恩、比利·琼·海沃思以及助长他们持续痛苦的比利·琼的朋友们有着共同的仇恨。许多信息都包含某种威胁，或是对这个群体施加暴力、伤害甚至死亡的渴望。芭芭拉和克里斯尤其为珍妮尔感到担忧，她承受了该群体恶意的最大冲击。克里斯称她为他的小妹妹，因为他从高中起就认识她了。阅读这些消息后，洛特特工觉得波特家的电脑会掌握更多线索。

39
00:35:30.000 --> 00:36:22.000
The police were not aware of the Potters having a son. Barbara mostly spoke to Chris about the harassment her family had received following their move to Mountain City. They shared a mutual hatred for Bill Payne, Billie Jean Hayworth, and Billie Jean's friends for fueling their ongoing grief. Many of the messages included some sort of threat or desire for violence, harm, or death to the group. Barbara and Chris were particularly worried for Janelle, who bore the brunt of the group's maliciousness. Chris referred to her as his little sister, as he had known her since high school. Reading these messages, Agent Lott felt that the Potters computer would hold more clues.
幸运的是，从波特家中没收的绿色螺旋笔记本里包含了一份该家庭社交媒体和电子邮箱账户的用户名和密码列表。但由于他们怀疑那里的许多通信可能已被删除，调查人员还获得了传票，以获取该家庭电子邮箱和互联网提供商的记录。洛特特工收到了一张包含 20,000 多封电子邮件的光盘。其中有些内容格外引人注目。一月中旬，芭芭拉给自己发送了两个链接：“上帝能原谅一个谋杀犯吗？”以及“关于宽恕和谋杀的问题”。为什么在比尔和比利·琼被杀前两周，芭芭拉会琢磨上帝是否能原谅谋杀犯呢？

40
00:36:22.000 --> 00:37:24.000
Fortunately, the green spiral notebook seized from the Potters home contained a list of usernames and passwords to the family's social media and email accounts. But as they suspected that many of the communications there might have been deleted, investigators also obtained subpoenas for records from the family's email and internet providers. Agent Lott received a DVD containing over 20,000 emails. Something stood out among them. In mid-January, Barbara had sent herself two links. Can God forgive a murderer? And questions about forgiveness and murder? Why would Barbara be wondering about whether God could forgive murderers two weeks before Bill and Billie Jean were killed?
对调查人员来说，查明芭芭拉每天发信息的神秘克里斯究竟是谁至关重要。谋杀案发生前一年，克里斯第一次给芭芭拉发电子邮件，写道：“嗨，芭芭拉，你好吗？希望你一切都好。是的，我是克里斯，又名科迪。听到发生这一切我很难过。希望有什么办法能帮到你们大家。”他透露自己一直在山城话题论坛上，并看到了针对波特一家的蔑视。他承认自己在网页上发表评论为他们辩护，因为网站管理员对这种有毒言论无动于衷。他向芭芭拉保证他已经处理好了。但事情非但没有停止，反而升级了。

