I love the friends that I have down here. They are sweet and wonderful people. In truth, Janelle had been struggling to build any authentic and reciprocal relationships since arriving in Mountain City. The locals were uncomfortable by her lack of social awareness and the way she acted overly familiar with them. Sometimes she went in for an unwelcome hug. She towered over other women standing at over six feet tall, but had a high-pitched child-like voice that didn't align with her large frame. That didn't stop Janelle from adding everyone she knew as well as people she didn't to her Facebook page. Online, she described herself as a loving and caring person who had been told she was too nice and so sweet. But she conceded,
我喜欢我在南边结交的朋友。他们都是甜美而美好的人。事实上，自从来到山城以来，珍妮尔一直难以建立任何真实且互惠的人际关系。当地人对她缺乏社交意识以及她对他们表现得过于熟络的方式感到不适。有时她会突然上前给人一个不受欢迎的拥抱。她身高超过六英尺，俯视着其他女性，却有着高亢的、孩子般的声音，这与她高大的身形很不相符。但这并没有阻止珍妮尔将她认识的所有人以及她不认识的人都加到她的Facebook页面上。在网上，她将自己描述为一个充满爱心和关怀的人，别人总是对她说她太好、太甜美了。但她也承认，

